{"id":"633421","name":"玉米面红枣窝窝","author":"一溪月","authorId":"10449735","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/633421/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"玉米面","amount":"一碗"},{"name":"白面","amount":"一碗"}],"sub":[{"name":"发酵粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"少许"},{"name":"去核红枣","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"一碗玉米面，一碗白面。","img":"images/633421/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"少许白糖。","img":"images/633421/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"发酵粉温水和开。","img":"images/633421/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"酵母水倒入面粉中，搅成絮状。","img":"images/633421/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"和成偏软的面团。自然饧发。","img":"images/633421/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"去核红枣切成小粒。","img":"images/633421/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"天热，很快饧发好了。","img":"images/633421/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入红枣碎。","img":"images/633421/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"揉均匀。","img":"images/633421/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"揪成大小均匀的剂子。","img":"images/633421/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"揉圆，按压成窝窝头状。","img":"images/633421/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"冷水上屉，饧5分钟，中小火蒸20分钟。","img":"images/633421/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"时间到，焖三四分钟，开盖。","img":"images/633421/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/633421/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/633421/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}